            "author_association": "OWNER",
            "body": "The `tangle` check is red, but not because of this PR. It reports drift in `sp-litnotes-refs.el` and `sp-litnotes-titles.el`, which this PR does not touch. The base branch #513 fails the same check for the same files, and `main` already has the fix (`48fd786`, \"Re-tangle sp-litnotes-refs and sp-litnotes-titles from their docs\").\n\nMerging `main` into this branch conflicts in `hammerspoon/.config/hammerspoon/devonthink.lua`, a file that belongs to #513. So I am not resolving it here: that would give two different resolutions to reconcile later. Once #513 has merged `main`, this PR picks the fix up with a plain merge of #513's branch, and I will re-check CI.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
